        <div>
                    <h1 class="content-page-head__title title-h2"><span>Contacts</span>
</h1>
        </div>
                  <div class="content-page-head__desc">
            <p>
  Find all the contact forms you need to reach Thales' specialized teams. Whether you're a media professional, supplier, or investor, use the dedicated forms to connect directly with the right service. Streamline your inquiries and get timely responses from our expert teams, tailored to your specific needs.
</p>

